        "item": "The characters joke; the world doesn't. Mum, the rival, townsfolk and the creatures' personalities carry the humour. Bleached reefs and empty villages are shown straight.",
        "verdict": "note",
        "text": "We don't need to try too hard with humor. Maybe we can try some jokes and see how it feels. ",
        "updatedAt": "2026-11-16T02:43:04.624Z"
      },
      {
